  F("Pick the correct reply to 'I'm not a morning person.'",["Me too.","So am I.","Neither am I.","Neither do I."],"Neither am I.","Negative with am → Neither am I."),
  B("আপনি কি রাফির সাথে পরিচিত হয়েছেন?",["Have you met Rafi?","Did you meet with Rafi already?","Are you meet Rafi?","You know Rafi met?"],"Have you met Rafi?","Have you met…?"),
  T("Ending politely.","It was great ___ to you. See you at the meeting!","verb",["talking"],"It was great talking to you."),
